== Effects ==
* Gives a chance, upon picking up a coin, to increase the value of that coin by 1.
** {{dlc|nr}} 50% chance.
** {{dlc|r}} The chance is based on the coin's worth:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.50<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
