== Notes ==
* This trinket can be found from destroying {{E|Golden Poop}} and {{E|Special Shopkeeper}}s.
* {{dlc+|a}} Counterfeit Penny allows the chance for {{C|Keeper}} / {{c|Tainted Keeper}} to gain the full value of a coin while healing, or to heal 2 coin hp from a single penny.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} If picked up by {{C|Jacob and Esau}}, only the brother holding Counterfeit Penny can trigger the effect.{{dlc-}}

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either gives the chance to increase the value of collected coins by 2. Having both by 3.

